# Mutants of the graphics layer's object (at/grlayer, src/at/AtGraphicsLayer.cpp). Each text occurs exactly once. Run by
# tests/oracle/oracle_grlayer.cpp. The heap mutants (one to each setter call, its field taken as 0, so the default heap) are written by a script
# from the source; the rest by hand.
#
# Dropped as equivalent, each with its reason:
#  * In AtGraphicsSetHeaps, the first of each pair of calls to the same setter (AtMatAssignment, AtShader, AtImageDatabase): the second call, with
#    the same field, always comes later in the same function, and nothing reads the global between them.
#  * The layer's Shutdown clearing +0x24: its base's Shutdown, called just before, has cleared it already (0x000C8210).
#  * Copying the render table before its matrix part (written first, as a mutant, by mistake): both orders leave both tables the same.
#  * The stand-ins' setters (src/at/AtGraphicsLayerStandIns.cpp): not this subsystem's.

